                            "users"
                          ]
                        },
                        "description": "Creates or updates multiple users in a single request.\n\nUse this endpoint to mass create or update users by providing an array of user objects in the request body. Each object may include core user attributes (such as login, name, email, and status) as well as custom user fields. If a user already exists, the body needs to have the corresponding id and their information will be updated. If the user does not exist, a new user is created.\n\nThis endpoint is ideal for bulk user provisioning, HRIS synchronization, and large-scale user updates, including custom field updates."
                      },
